silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_04_layered_sequencing_concrete_anchor_5 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 04_layered_sequencing #5', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Layered Sequencing' the bare symbol |[terminalnode]| (L_5) anchors to MittensVetRecordDependsOnCitationKey: The dependency arrow: the published claim depends on the citation key, which depends on the source-boundary declaration; reversing this would create a cycle and break acyclicity.." .
